Example 9 Find X and Y , if \(\mathrm{X}+\mathrm{Y}=\left[\begin{array}{ll}5 & 2 \\ 0 & 9\end{array}\right]\) and \(\mathrm{X}-\mathrm{Y}=\left[\begin{array}{cc}3 & 6 \\ 0 & -1\end{array}\right]\).
