(x) \(\frac{d}{d x}\left(\tan ^{-1} x\right)=\frac{1}{1+x^{2}}\);
(xi) \(\frac{d}{d x}\left(e^{x}\right)=e^{x}\);

Integrals (Anti derivatives)
\(\int x^{n} d x=\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+\mathrm{C}, n \neq-1\)
