Hence
\[\mathrm{P}(\mathrm{E} \mid \mathrm{F})=\frac{\mathrm{P}(\mathrm{E} \cap \mathrm{~F})}{\mathrm{P}(\mathrm{~F})}=\frac{\frac{1}{6}}{\frac{3}{4}}=\frac{2}{9}\]

